stateDiagram-v2
  Unknown: Waiting person not recorded
  Recorded: Recorded person and reason visible
  Review: Inline evidence open with recorded person visible
  Confirmed: Completed receipt visible, waiting person hidden
  Done: Card in Done today
  [*] --> Unknown
  Unknown --> Recorded: Save person and receive canonical readback
  Recorded --> Review: Open Review card
  Review --> Confirmed: Mark done and receive exact receipt and readback
  Confirmed --> Done: Close review
  Done --> Unknown: Undo using the completion event and receive reopened card
